      "name": "schmuck.",
      "bio": "East Village cocktail bar from Moe Aljaff and Juliette Larrouy, the duo behind Barcelona's Two Schmucks, opened in January 2025 on the corner of First Avenue and 6th Street. Two rooms, a lounge-style living room and a communal kitchen table, each with its own menu of ingredient-led drinks and Middle Eastern and European bar food. No. 4 on North America's 50 Best Bars 2026.",
