      "name": "Bar Snack",
      "bio": "A 1970s-flavoured neighbourhood bar on Second Avenue in the East Village, led by bartender Iain Griffiths and opened in late 2024. Its motto is dressed-up classics for dressed-down people, and its name comes from the snaquiri, a small pour of the seasonal house daiquiri that also comes by the glass or pitcher. Named Best U.S. Cocktail Bar at the 2026 Spirited Awards. No. 3 on North America's 50 Best Bars 2026.",
