      "name": "Clemente Bar",
      "bio": "Art-filled cocktail lounge one floor above Eleven Madison Park, born from a collaboration between chef Daniel Humm and painter Francesco Clemente, whose works line the room. Opened in late 2024 with a rotating menu of technical but restrained cocktails and plant-based bar bites, plus The Studio, a nine-seat chef's counter next door. No. 15 on North America's 50 Best Bars 2026.",
      "website": "https://www.clementebar.com/",
