    {
      "handle": "martinys_nyc",
      "name": "Martiny's",
      "bio": "Japanese-style cocktail bar spread over three floors of an 1800s Gramercy carriage house once used by sculptor Philip Martiny. Opened in 2022 by Tokyo-born Takuma Watanabe after eight years as head bartender of Angel's Share, it pairs omotenashi hospitality and crystal glassware with a course-by-course cocktail list. Watanabe was U.S. Bartender of the Year at the 2026 Spirited Awards. No. 23 on North America's 50 Best Bars 2026.",
      "website": "https://www.martinys.com/",
