  "notes": [
    "The 2026 World's 50 Best Bars top 50 is announced in Milan on 7 October 2026; only the 2026 51-100 list (published 23 September 2026) is included. Sip & Guzzle, Overstory, Schmuck and others may land in that top 50.",
    "The 2026 World list is branded 'The 50 Best Bars' by organisers; entered under the award name 'The World's 50 Best Bars' as the brief requires.",
    "schmuck. styles its name in lowercase with a full stop (Tales of the Cocktail and the bar's Instagram use 'schmuck.'; 50 Best writes 'Schmuck'). Instagram is @schmuck.ny; its website footer links @schmuckordie (the founders' wider brand).",
    "The Dead Rabbit's old domain deadrabbitnyc.com now serves an unrelated spam site; the bar's current site is thedeadrabbit.com. The bar's own history page claims World's Best Bar at the Spirited Awards in 2014 as well, but the Tales archive lists 2014's World's Best Cocktail Bar as Artesian (Dead Rabbit won Best American Cocktail Bar that year), so only 2015 is included.",
    "Dead Rabbit is not on North America's 50 Best Bars 2026 (1-100); included for historic importance (No. 1 World 2016).",
    "Clemente Bar coordinates use the Eleven Madison Park OSM node at the same address (the bar is upstairs). Martiny's coordinates come from the OSM building at 121 East 17th Street, still tagged with a previous tenant's name.",
    "Maison Premiere: OSM gives postcode 11211, the bar's own site gives 11249; used 11249.",
    "Eleven Madison Park (not Clemente Bar) won World's Best Spirits Selection at the 2025 Spirited Awards; not attributed to Clemente. Martiny's Takuma Watanabe won U.S. Bartender of the Year 2026 (personal award, mentioned in bio only).",
    "Martiny's, Sip & Guzzle, Bar Snack (except the snaquiri) and schmuck. drinks come from press or 50 Best pages, not a current menu (Martiny's items date from 2022), so on_current_menu is false. Bar Snack's current menu is an image-only Canva embed.",
    "Near misses: Angel's Share, Katana Kitten, Dante (Spirited World's Best Bar 2019), Bar Madonna, PDT, Death & Co."
  ]
